    "result_text": "Done. The build passes and the acceptance test is green (`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0`). The audit log confirms the new format working end-to-end: `memberId=NSW2716E6609E1` (`NSW` + `27` fiscal year + `16E6609E` HASH8 + `1` Luhn check).\n\n## What I changed\n\n**New unified identity value type** \u2014 `model/MemberId.java` (replacing `CustomerCode.java`):\n- `of(region, fiscalYearSegment, telephone, lastName)` builds `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>` \u2014 reusing `Sha256.hexPrefix(...,8)` for HASH8 and `Luhn.checkDigit(...)` over the `<REGION><FY><HASH8>` base for CHK.\n- `regionOf` / `fiscalYearSegmentOf` read the region and fiscal year back by their fixed 11-char trailing offset (FY 2 + HASH8 8 + CHK 1), ignoring any `-<n>` de-dup suffix.\n\n**`Owner`** \u2014 replaced the `customerCode` field/column (`customer_code` \u2192 `member_id`) with `memberId`; removed `getCustomerCode`/`setCustomerCode`, `getMembershipNumber`, and `getCheckDigit`. `getPrimaryIdentifier()`, `getLocality()`, and `getFiscalYear()` now all reference `memberId` (fiscal year read from its FY segment via a new `FiscalYear.label(int)` overload). `getOwnerSegment()` follows automatically through `getLocality()`.\n\n**`MemberIdGenerator`** (replacing `CustomerCodeGenerator`) \u2014 mints the member id from region + effective-registration fiscal year + identity, with collision de-duplication now applied to the member id via `existsByMemberId`.\n\n**Repositories** \u2014 renamed `existsByCustomerCode` \u2192 `existsByMemberId` across the interface, JPA, JDBC (`member_id` column), and Spring Data impls.\n\n**Wiring & audit** \u2014 `ClinicServiceImpl` uses the renamed generator/accessors; `OwnerAuditor` logs `memberId` (dropping the separate `membershipNumber`); `OwnerCreatedEvent`'s component is now `memberId`.\n\n**Schema & API** \u2014 `member_id` column in all four DB schemas (widened to `VARCHAR(32)`/`TEXT` to hold the longer format plus any collision suffix); `openapi.yml` now exposes a single `memberId` property, drops `customerCode`/`membershipNumber`/`checkDigit`, and updates the `fiscalYear`/`locality` descriptions to reference the member id.",
